# Battles, wars, sieges and military campaigns with a participant whose religion (P140) is Islam or a subclass (Q432). Redesigned 2026-10-12: the first version required the participant itself to be a subclass of Islam, which matched one item; participants are states, dynasties and armies, so the test is on their religion. Classes: battle Q178561, war Q198, siege Q188055, military campaign Q645883. Tested: 2,614 items in 20 s.
SELECT DISTINCT ?item WHERE { VALUES ?cls { wd:Q178561 wd:Q198 wd:Q188055 wd:Q645883 } ?item wdt:P31/wdt:P279* ?cls . ?item wdt:P710 ?p . ?p wdt:P140/wdt:P279* wd:Q432 . } LIMIT 20000
